Ranger Help for: improve
========================

SYNTAX:      improve <str/dex/con/wis/int/chr/level/guild>
USAGE:       Any wilderness terrain.

SUMMARY:
Advance your stats, game level, or guild level. You must be in a
wilderness area (not city, inside, or dock terrain).

  improve str/dex/con/int/wis/chr   Raise a stat (costs experience)
  improve level                      Raise game level (costs exp + gold)
  improve guild                      Raise guild level (costs experience)

Your guild level cannot exceed your game level. Use 'cost' to see
current prices. You must have your primary terrain, secondary terrain,
and enemy species set before you can advance anything.

=============================================================================
